{"ref":"BDB, רְבִיבִים","hw":"רְבִיבִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְבִיבִים</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">Je 3:3</a> <strong>pl. copious showers</strong>, causing fertility;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.2\">Dt 32:2</a> + 3 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבִבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.22\">Je 14:22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבִבִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">3:3</a>;—<em>copious showers</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">Je 3:3</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְקוֹשׁ</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְּנוּ ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.22\">14:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגְשִׁמִים</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:11\" href=\"/Psalms.65.11\">ψ 65:11</a>; sim., of penetrating, pervasive infl. of prophetic words <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.2\">Dt 32:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעִירִם</span>, also <span dir=\"rtl\">מָטָר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">טַל</span>), of Jacob <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:6\" href=\"/Micah.5.6\">Mi 5:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">טַל</span>), of future king <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:6\" href=\"/Psalms.72.6\">ψ 72:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָטָר</span>).","next":"BDB, יָֽרָבְעָם","prev":"BDB, רַבִּית"}